# Living instruction document

If the project uses a living guide (see deploy checklist B2):

- Keep `docs/` or `Legacy/Instruction_Streamlit_YYYY-MM-DD.md` up to date when layers, pages, or public service APIs change.
- Include: purpose, folder tree, 5-layer map, decisions pointer, AI do/don’t.
- Keep a universal draft template if one exists; don’t delete it when specializing.
